  "notes": [
    {
      "source_id": "src-1639318a6760",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.0,
      "range": "00:00\u201300:03",
      "text": "Anthropic, the company behind Claude just filed to go public."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "src-1639318a6760",
      "start": 3.0,
      "end": 7.0,
      "range": "00:03\u201300:07",
      "text": "Buried in the SEC filings are some absolutely insane admissions."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "src-1639318a6760",
      "start": 7.0,
      "end": 10.0,
      "range": "00:07\u201300:10",
      "text": "1. AI could cause human extinction, nothing less."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "src-1639318a6760",
      "start": 11.0,
      "end": 14.0,
      "range": "00:11\u201300:14",
      "text": "2. Models have exhibited self-preservation behaviors."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "src-1639318a6760",
      "start": 14.0,
      "end": 18.0,
      "range": "00:14\u201300:18",
      "text": "3. AI has attempted to resist shutdowns."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "src-1639318a6760",
      "start": 18.0,
      "end": 21.0,
      "range": "00:18\u201300:21",
      "text": "4. Models have demonstrated blackmail and deception."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "src-1639318a6760",
      "start": 22.0,
      "end": 27.0,
      "range": "00:22\u201300:27",
      "text": "5. AI may recognize when it's being tested and deliberately change its behavior."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "src-1639318a6760",
      "start": 27.0,
      "end": 31.0,
      "range": "00:27\u201300:31",
      "text": "6. Advanced AI could undermine government and institutions."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "src-1639318a6760",
      "start": 31.0,
      "end": 35.0,
      "range": "00:31\u201300:35",
      "text": "7. AI could concentrate unprecedented power and wealth."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "src-1639318a6760",
      "start": 35.0,
      "end": 40.0,
      "range": "00:35\u201300:40",
      "text": "8. Future AI systems could surpass the world's leading human experts."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "src-1639318a6760",
      "start": 40.0,
      "end": 43.0,
      "range": "00:40\u201300:43",
      "text": "9. AI could become increasingly difficult for humans to control."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "src-1639318a6760",
      "start": 43.0,
      "end": 49.0,
      "range": "00:43\u201300:49",
      "text": "10. Anthropic acknowledges that developing more powerful AI could increase the risk of catastrophic harm."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "src-1639318a6760",
      "start": 49.0,
      "end": 53.0,
      "range": "00:49\u201300:53",
      "text": "These are disclosures from the company building the technology, not the SEC."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "src-1639318a6760",
      "start": 53.0,
      "end": 56.0,
      "range": "00:53\u201300:56",
      "text": "This is absolutely crazy. What do you think?"
    }
  ]
}
